  "historyNote": "#7552, INTERIM, eff 9-5-01, EXPIRED: 3-4-02 New. #7747, eff 8-17-02; ss by #9496, eff 6-26-09; ss by #12477, eff 2-8-18 (formerly Saf-C 6202.01); ss by #13247, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 8-3-21; ss by #13318, eff 12-22-21",
